# gcovr configuration (gcovr >= 8).
#
# gcovr 8.x only accepts a limited set of options from a config file; the
# `--exclude` file list and the `--fail-under-line` gate are CLI-only in
# gcovr 8, so the authoritative gate lives in:
#   - cmake/tooling.cmake  (local `cmake --build build --target coverage`)
#   - .github/workflows/coverage.yml  (CI)
# This file documents the shared 4-file exclude list (AGENTS.md coverage
# campaign) and the 80% target. Do NOT rely on `--config .gcovr` — it will
# reject fail_under_line under gcovr 8.
filter = src/
